---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import portrait from "../../assets/images/profile/portrait.webp";
---

<section>
    <div>
        <p>
            Hi there! I’m Jatinder, a Computer Science and Mathematics Joint
            Honours Co-op student at the University of Manitoba, minoring in
            Statistics.
        </p>
        <p>
            My interests span discrete algorithms, computational geometry,
            scientific computing, and low-level systems programming. I
            especially enjoy problems that connect mathematical reasoning and
            analysis with programming.
        </p>
        <p>
            This site brings together my projects, research, work, teaching
            experience, and education, as well as a few useful documents. It
            will keep evolving as I learn and build more, so I encourage you to
            check back every now and then!
        </p>

        <div>
            <a href="/projects/"> View projects </a>
            <a href="/about/"> More about me </a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <figure>
        <Image
            src={portrait}
            alt="Portrait of Jatinder Sahota"
            widths={[320, 480, 640]}
            loading="eager"
        />
    </figure>
</section>
